  "contentHtml": "<p><font color=\"#e40dc3\" face=\"se-nanumgothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">책보다가 생각난 아이디어들 적어둔 건데요. 소화전, 소화기에 해태이미지 붙이기는 과학의 달 행사나 적절한 시기에 끼워넣기 괜찮은 듯 해서 올립니다^^</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#e40dc3\" face=\"se-nanumgothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#e40dc3\" face=\"se-nanumgothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></font></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(228, 13, 195); font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">역사 선생님과 콜라보하고 싶은 학교이벤트</span><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(228, 13, 195); font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-size: 32px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-D62DC5D5-C273-4E82-BBD9-7FD6C77FD39D\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-F39D61C2-4DF6-46E5-AC44-D99ED92E0861\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1. 외규장각의궤 그림으로 굿즈 만들기 콘테스트</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-7B99E1CB-FFE9-4A51-9A7B-2EF0D5CE0359\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2E7DAD0E-B723-4DF2-8705-764FD2AF70F0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">: 역사 전반에 걸쳐 그런 컨텐츠가 많겠지만, 의궤 그림은 이미지가 깔끔하고 귀염한 느낌이 있어서 이쁜 굿즈 많이 나올 수 있을 것 같은데, 현재 박물관에서 파는 것들이 한계가 있어 아쉬워서.. </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-DDD063AD-BE9D-455D-81B0-FFDE14BA93C3\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5B54F1BE-AA95-4C57-9688-8AE30D9C556A\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">외규장각의궤를 찾아내고 국내로 가져오기까지의 스토리도 아이들이 좀 더 잘 알면 좋겠고..</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-6E246658-6FE4-4F83-90F3-5F0496663278\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0749E39E-AF7F-4716-AF1F-8C482DC510B4\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-C47E2507-2B3D-4AE0-8F55-8FC3657F5A3B\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-CBDB71F8-C92F-46FA-B720-765B17CEB249\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">2. 소화전, 소화기에 해태 이미지 붙이기</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-2B20821E-BA26-4B23-8D4E-731E6F1B453D\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5A40B1CE-A5AB-4CF7-A00F-73ADDE1052D3\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">: 광화문 앞에 해태가 있는 이유, 조선 건국 후 한양에  궁궐터 잡을 때 이야기 등 연결시켜서~ </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" id=\"SE-682E9357-C366-4F6E-BC3A-6FB5F662D42F\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-AED95A9D-3559-4F29-8E2C-E483528496EC\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">학교에 화재가 나지 않기 바라는 마음으로 학생들과 해태이미지 붙이는 행사를 하면 좋을 것 같기도</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}